{
    desc => q{da' deletes text including surrounding single quotes},
    description => <<'END_DESC',
Macro: `xt/visual/macros/text_object_da_singlequote`

Tests the `da'` text object which deletes text **including** the
single quote delimiters themselves.

**initial.png** — Cursor on 'h' inside the single quotes at line 1 col 10.

Keys: `da'`

**after_da_singlequote.png** — The entire `'hello world'` including both
single quotes is removed. Line 1 now reads `my $x = ;`.
